),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "到了蝉鸣的喧嚣渐渐平静下来的时节。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00053",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "我仍然待在医院之中。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00054",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "当然了，我也不是一直都住在医院里。只是不停地重复着入院与出院的过程。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00055",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "上个月，我经历了平生的第一次手术。\n出院后，要去离家５分钟车程的医院去接受定期检查。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00056",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "之后便是住院，出院，检查，住院的循环…",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00057",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "尽管不知道ＰＥＴ啊易瑞沙啊都是些什么东西，\n等回过神来，这单调的循环已经持续了几个月。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00058",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "与食欲越来越差相对应，服用药物的量与种类与日俱增。\n我自己也能实际感受到，体力明显下降了",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00059",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "我发觉双腿越来越消瘦，",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00060",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "”这并不是错觉”，体重计的指针告诉我。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00061",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "但是…",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00062",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "像是旁观者一般看着这一切。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00063",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "与其说是旁观的那种冷漠，简直就如同只是在看着电视里播出的一段镜头似的。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00064",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "事发突然，身上发生的事情，脑袋还没有反应过来。\n我无法对发生的这一切产生任何的实感。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00065",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "所以，尽管是发生在自己身上的事情，\n但我看待它的方式却仿佛自己是局外人似的。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00066",
),
),
(
